 ance of David Austin® Roses!\n\nWhether you’re a longtime admirer or ju
 st discovering these iconic English roses\, this inspiring program will ex
 plore their rich history\, unforgettable fragrance\, graceful bloom forms\
 , and how to successfully grow them in your own garden. Featuring special 
 guest speaker Rebecca Koraytem of David Austin® Roses USA (BS & MS Hortic
 ulture\; former Southern Living editor\, and award-winning writer & design
 er). \n\nProgram topics include:\n\n• The art & science of rose breedin
 g\n\n• New and notable varieties\n\n• Garden design inspiration\n\n•
  Essential care tips for thriving roses\n\n• Q&A + special drawing to fo
 llow\n\nAll gardening levels welcome—from curious beginners to seasoned 
 rosarians. Space is limited\, so reserve your seat today! sonomaroses.org/
 dar
