DESCRIPTION:Savor the tastes of Spain with authentic paella by nationally 
 acclaimed\, locally owned Gerard's Paella\, made with locally sourced ingr
 edients and finished with our very own Gold Ridge Organic Farms Extra Virg
 in Olive Oil — all to the sounds of live Spanish guitar by Bay Area musi
 cian\, Jean-Paul.\n\nOn the menu (available from 11:30am to 2:30pm or unti
 l sold out):\n\nVegan Paella ($20): tomato\, cannellini beans\, zucchini\,
  asparagus\, mushrooms\, olives\, arugula\, sofrito\, paprika\, and saffro
 n rice\n\nTapas Plate ($22): Manchego cheese drizzled with Picholine Blend
  Extra Virgin Olive Oil (4)\, stuffed peppers drizzled with Tuscan Blend E
 xtra Virgin Olive Oil (4)\, crositini with asparagus\, roasted red pepper 
 & Romesco Sauce drizzled with Arbequina Blend Extra Virgin Olive Oil (4)\,
  olives\, fruit\n\nThere's plenty more to enjoy while you're here. Sample 
 our award-winning organic olive oils and apple products\, cool off with a
 n apple cider slushie or Straus ice cream drizzled with apple cider syrup\
 , and pick up something special from the Farm Shop.\n\nYou can also meet t
 he makers behind family-owned Santa Rosa roaster Bella Rosa Coffee\, smal
 l-batch stone-ground salsa maker Tienda Salsita\, and Sonoma County illus
 trator Kate Pinto of Bean Horse Car Designs. \n\nTake a ride through our
  olive and apple orchards on the apple-themed decorative trolley. Tours de
 part at 11:30AM\, 12PM\, 12:30PM\, 1PM\, 1:30PM\, and 2PM.\n\nFree entry. 
 Food\, drinks and orchard tour tickets available for purchase on the day.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
