DESCRIPTION:Ready to bring the energy\, rhythm\, and joy of Brazil into yo
 ur life? Join us for an exciting Samba Beginner Workshop designed specific
 ally for absolute beginners. No dance experience or partner required!\n\nL
 ed by the incredible duo Eric and Abigail\, you’ll dive into the vibran
 t world of Samba\, learning the foundational steps that will get you movin
 g with confidence.\n\nWhat You’ll Learn:\n\n• The Samba Basics: Maste
 r the core footwork and infectious rhythms.\n\n• Body Mechanics: Learn 
 how to find your bounce\, coordination\, and posture.\n\n• Musicality: 
 Understand the beat so you can dance naturally to any Samba track.\n\nWork
 shop Details:\n\n• Dates: Saturday\, June 20 & Saturday\, July 11\n\n
 • Time: 3:00 PM – 4:30 PM\n\n• Instructors: Eric & Abigail\n\n• L
 evel: Absolute Beginner \\(all fitness levels welcome!\\)\n\nSecure your 
