BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Alex Wintz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T000000
UID:260331dyHdJhyl5kWiJR67L9jHSA
DESCRIPTION:Rising\, young guitarist Alex Wintz is quickly gaining a name 
 in the international jazz community. His talent and embrace of contemporar
 y influences molded with a deep gratitude to the traditions of the past ha
 s garnered him numerous accolades and acclaim from music lovers across the
  globe. Wintz is a frequent collaborator with Etienne Charles\, Ben Willia
 ms and Sound Effect\,  Roxy Coss\, Peter and Will Anderson\, and Nick Finz
 er and has performed at the Newport\, Monterey\, Montreux\, and Montreal J
 azz Festivals\, among other major venues. \n\nIn May 2017 Wintz released 
 “LifeCycle”\, his debut recording on Etienne Charles’ Culture Shock 
 imprint. The album\, both challenging and accessible has garnered critical
  acclaim since it's release with strong endorsements from Downbeat Magazin
 e \\(3.5 Stars\\)\, All About Jazz\, and The New York Jazz Record.
LOCATION:Healdsburg Jazz
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108142458?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Zach Neil
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T000000
UID:260331QVpYn7iyGE-NyaHoP1wcHg
DESCRIPTION:Updated Bio\n\nZach Neil is the 2022 Texas Country Music Assoc
 iation’s Male Artist of the Year and has earned five consecutive Top 40 
 Texas country singles – not bad for a guy who planned to follow in his d
 ad’s footsteps and become a farmer. Farming was the family business and 
 still is\, but Zach decided to use the work ethic he acquired from his fam
 ily and focus on a career in music. Zach is a singer\, songwriter and live
  performer who uniquely puts his own twist on traditional country music. \
 n\n“I love playing live. Every show is different\, every crowd is differ
 ent. Each night on stage is a chance for me to grow and share my love for 
 country music.”\n\nHis Texas country hits include:\n\n•	“When She Dr
 inks Whiskey” \\(2019\\)\n\n•	“Something In The Stars” \\(2020\\)\
 n\n•	“Half Bad” \\(2021\\)\n\n•	“Long Live The Cowboy” \\(2022
 \\)\n\n•	“All The Pretty Horses\,” \\(2022\\) – which stayed in th
 e Top 20 of the Texas Country Music Chart for multiple weeks. \n\nZach’s
  new single “Till The Numbers Run Out” is now on Texas country radio\,
  on all streaming platforms\, and available for download wherever you get 
 your music.\n\nVisit www.zachneilmusic.com to learn more about Zach and fo
 r a complete list of upcoming tour dates.
LOCATION:Wing & Barrel Ranch
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108155154?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
