 major promotions on OSHA-compliant first aid kits\, trauma bags\, and disa
 ster survival supplies. Event Details Date: Saturday\, June 20 Location: 4
 64 Kenwood Ct\, Suite G\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95407 Travel Time: ~7-minute dri
 ve from central Santa Rosa What to Expect Free Training Demos: Interactive
  CPR\, First Aid\, and AED sessions led by experienced firefighters and pa
 ramedics. Disaster Supplies: Exclusive access to their merged "Earth Shake
 s" inventory\, featuring earthquake\, wildfire\, and flood survival kits f
 or families and businesses. Safety Consultation: Meet the experts to discu
 ss OSHA-compliant workplace safety protocols and customized emergency resp
 onse planning. Check the First In Training site for more information on cl
 ass schedules and retail products. Actual ribbon cutting will take place a
 t 9:30 am
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/988712324016991/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
