BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Merry Wives of Windsor
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T193000
UID:2605265jwwarjixU-kKtPAt8slAA
DESCRIPTION:Curtain Call Theatre proudly presents William Shakespeare's Th
 e Merry Wives of Windsor\, one of Shakespeare's warmest and most delightfu
 lly entertaining comedies. Set in the lively town of Windsor\, the play fo
 llows the famously boastful Sir John Falstaff as he hatches a scheme to so
 lve his financial troubles by courting two wealthy married women at the sa
 me time. What Falstaff does not anticipate is that Mistress Ford and Mistr
 ess Page are far cleverer than he is - and fully prepared to teach him a l
 esson. As the wives join forces to outwit their would-be suitor\, the town
  erupts into a whirlwind of comic misunderstandings\, jealous husbands\, s
 ecret meetings\, disguises\, and playful revenge. Alongside the central pr
 ank unfolds a charming subplot of young love\, as Anne Page's many eager s
 uitors compete for her hand while she quietly pursues her own path. Filled
  with wit\, music\, physical comedy\, and memorable characters\, The Merry
  Wives of Windsor is Shakespeare at his most accessible and joyful. Beneat
 h the laughter lies a celebration of friendship\, resilience\, and the cle
 verness of ordinary people who refuse to be fooled. Curtain Call Theatre's
  production brings this timeless comedy to life with energy\, heart\, and 
 a spirit of community that invites audiences of all ages to share in the f
 un.
LOCATION:D
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/the-merry-wives-of-windsor/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
