BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:MovingWriting: Embodied Expressive Writing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T170000
UID:260129ZpB2SyqKiES8tPY5KNHfHg
DESCRIPTION:In *MovingWriting* workshops\, we play with movement/dance a
 nd words to help us connect with our deep and creative selves in the compa
 ny of a supportive circle. Giving voice to our own stories and witnessing 
 the stories of others brings healing\, aliveness\, and connection with oth
 ers.\n\nNo moving or writing experience necessary!\n\nHere's what a few re
 cent *MovingWriting* participants had to say about their experience:\n\n
 “Loretta's well-crafted writing prompts sparked a writer inside me that 
 I didn't know I had… I left feeling invigorated\, accomplished and proud
  of myself for trying something new.”\n\n“I'm neither a writer nor a d
 ancer\, but Loretta made it easy to put aside my inhibitions and let my em
 otional body lead the way… I recommend this class for anybody at all!”
 \n\n"It felt delicious to dive into my creative moving and language self w
 ith others. For days after\, I felt both emptied and filled up creatively 
 in ways that I hadn’t felt in a long time."\n\n"I felt refreshed\, renew
 ed\, and like I had processed some emotional blockages… The paths were o
 pened and the words just flowed."\n\nCome move and write with us! Visit ww
 w.MovingWriting.com to learn more & register for upcoming events.
LOCATION:A private studio in Sebastopol
URL:http://www.MovingWriting.com
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
