UID:260610F5lCBhjpXEOUlPmkgnXw7g
DESCRIPTION:“….Get ready for the super-entertaining sounds of local ba
 nd The Social Contractors. They totally rock\, in all the right ways…”
  - Argus-Courier\n\nJoin The Social Contractors\, for free live music at L
 agunitas Petaluma TapRoom & Beer Sanctuary on Father's Day\, June 21st fro
 m 2:30-5 PM!  We'll be playing an upbeat blend of original alternative ro
 ck and classic hits from the 60s-90s. This show features Alex Fabian-Davie
 s (bass)\, Travis Cole Thayer (sax/keys/vocals)\, Chris Oatman (drums)\, a
 nd Jason Davies (guitar/vocals).
