 periences\, such as love\, heartbreak\, family or social commentary.  Thei
 r performances transition from soulful ballads to high-energy pop tunes\, 
 incorporating jazz improvisation and R&B grooves along the way\, taking th
 eir listeners on an exhilarating and heartfelt musical journey.
LOCATION:HEAD WEST Marketplace
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108051249?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
