UID:260326gk3uCgheWU2yF-pRN3O9TA
DESCRIPTION:​Vendors • Music • \n\n•Raffle • Bacon • \n\n​Su
 nday\, June 21\, 2026 \n\n \\(Father's Day\\)\n\n​Downtown Kelseyville\n
 \n11am - 4pm\n\nCome celebrate the joy of bacon at Lake County's 8th Annua
