DESCRIPTION:Summer Solstice Celebration is Marin Community Clinics’ sig
 nature annual fundraising event\, and this year marks the 20th anniversar
 y of this beloved community tradition.\n\nEach summer\, we bring together
  community leaders\, donors\, and advocates to welcome the longest day of 
 the year\, honor Community Health Champions\, and raise critical funds th
 at sustain equitable\, high-quality healthcare for patients and families a
 cross Marin County.\n\nGuests will enjoy an evening of food\, drink\, musi
 c\, and connection as we celebrate two decades of impact\, partnership\, a
 nd the collective power of community.\n\nEvent Details\n\nDate: June 25\, 
 2026\n\nTime: 5:00 p.m. - 7:30 p.m.\n\nLocation: Bill & Adele Jonas Cente
 r\n\n1800 Ignacio Blvd Building 19\, \n\nNovato\, CA 94949 \n\nIndividua
 l ticket: $250\n\nBecome a Sponsor: $1\,000-$25\,000\n\nPlease send your 
 guest names to events@marincli​nic.org\, and feel free to reach out wit
 h any questions.
LOCATION:Bill & Adele Jonas Center
