 local businesses that have successfully navigated the government procureme
 nt system.\n\nYou’ll learn how to get certified in California\, where to
  find state contracting opportunities\, and what it takes to compete and w
 in contracts. Plus\, you’ll have multiple opportunities to network with 
 government representatives and fellow business owners throughout the day. 
 Whether you’re just exploring contracting or ready to take the next step
 \, this workshop will equip you with tools\, insights\, and contacts to mo
 ve forward with confidence.
