BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pride Print Lab - Trace Monotype with Ash Hay
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T193000
UID:260607FIGfDFVXZUy38pbQQpaMRA
DESCRIPTION:Date & Time\n\nFriday\, June 26\, 2026\n\n5:30 PM – 7:30 PM\
 n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\nPrintmaking\n\nExperience Level\n\n
 All Levels\n\nAges\n\nAll Ages\n\nAdult Registration Cost:\n\n$15\n\nUnder
  15 Registration Cost:\n\nFree\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$15\n\nCeleb
 rate Pride at Print Lab with Ash Hay! Learn trace monotype printmaking in 
 this social art workshop. No experience needed\, create art to take home.\
 n\nprogram overview\n\nRoll up your sleeves and join us for a fun Print La
 b evening celebrating Pride Month\, with special guest\, Ash Hay – one o
 f our featured June Causeway Gallery artists! Print Lab is not a tradition
 al class\, but an affordable art-making experience. Our mission is to expl
 ore a creative arts technique socially with our community. We welcome you 
 to print\, play and experiment with an activity to create something unique
  in our printmaking studio! This month we will explore a fun printmaking t
 echnique known as Trace Monotype.  Trace monotypes involve drawing direct
 ly onto an inked plate and do not require the use of a press! The pressure
  of the pencil transfers the ink to the paper\, creating a soft look to pr
 ints with unlimited options. Guests will learn about the variety of mark m
 aking\, and explore expressive textures on an inky surface.  Ash Hay will
  give a short artist talk\, and teach the basics of creating trace monotyp
 es\, a printmaking process they enjoy using to create prints. They will sh
 are their process of incorporating layered prints\, as well as utilizing m
 ixed media. Come join us\, make some monotypes to take home\, and explore 
 the possibilities!  Enjoy light refreshments during this printmaking acti
 vity. No previous experience is necessary!
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/pride-print-lab/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
