BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wreckless Strangers and Pardon the Interruption at The California 
 Theater
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260626T200000
UID:260602aEpBHBGCzUS53u0DUnuRbA
DESCRIPTION:Fueled by national radio airplay and a climb up the Top 50 Ame
 ricana and AAA Singles charts\, Wreckless Strangers continue celebrating
  the release of their new album\, Dirty Souls\, with a summer run of per
 formances across the greater Bay Area. Newly announced dates include The 
 California Theater in Santa Rosa \\(with Pardon the Interruption\\) on J
 une 26\, the Point Richmond Outdoor Music Series on July 10\, the 4th 
 Annual Valley Car Show in Woodacre on July 18\, The Barn in Gilroy on
  July 19\, Live on the Avenue in San Anselmo on August 22\, the Old
  Western Saloon in Point Reyes Station on August 28\, the  Rio Nido R
 oadhouse on August 30 with stops in Colorado and Wyoming along the wa
 y!\n\nWith Dirty Souls\, Wreckless Strangers return to their rock-and-rol
 l roots\, delivering their rawest and most visceral studio effort to date.
  The six-song collection channels the arena rock spirit of the ’70s and 
 ’80s that shaped the band’s earliest influences while bringing a fresh
 \, modern edge to the sound. The first single\, "Dirty Soul\," released J
 anuary 23\, is receiving national airplay and is available on major stream
 ing platforms. The band released the full album on March 27.
LOCATION:The California
URL:https://www.caltheatre.com/event-details/wreckless-strangers-and-pti
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
