DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. Elevated Sessions is an 
 intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring award winning Wood W
 ide indoor flower and curated for the true cannabis connoisseur.\n\nJoin u
 s for a refined 60 minute session designed to awaken the senses. Your cann
 abis sommelier will guide you through 4 exceptional cultivars — explorin
 g their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and effects — while you sa
 vor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated snacks\, and palate cleans
 ers.\n\nThis is more than a tasting — it’s an immersive journey throug
 h craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed to elevate your evening\
 , from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive perks awaiting guests.\n\n
 Date & Sessions\n\nDate: Friday\, June 26\, 2026\n\nTwo Sessions: 6:00 PM 
 & 8:00 PM\n\nCapacity: 16 guests per session \\(32 tickets total\\)\n\nWha
 t’s Included\n\nEnjoy a refreshing Natural Soda – A cannabis-infused p
 alate opener\n\nGuided Tasting of 4 Curated Strains –Guests enjoy exclus
 ive cultivar drop\n\nTasting Passport – Track aromas\, effects\, and per
 sonal favorites\n\nCharcuterie & Palate Cleansers – Light bites designed
  for the session\n\nMeet The Grower – Learn how this award-winning flowe
 r was grown\n\nExclusive Perks – Discounts \\+ access to limited drops\n
 \nTicket Tiers \\(Limited to 16 Guests per Session\\)\n\n6:00 PM Tasting -
  $75: Includes 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport
 \, Natural Soda Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n8:00 PM Tasting - $75: I
 ncludes 🌱 $50 Goodie Bag\, 4 Curated Tastings\, Tasting Passport\, Natu
 ral Soda Bar\, Snacks & Exclusive Deals\n\n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-000042
 0-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis event is 21\\+ only. Valid gover
 nment-issued ID is required for entry. By attending this event at the Merc
 y Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that photography and video recording m
 ay take place. Images and footage may be used by Mercy Wellness for market
 ing and promotional purposes across various channels\, without compensatio
 n. Tickets are non-refundable unless otherwise stated. Event details\, tim
 ing\, or programming are subject to change.\n\nCannabis consumption is lim
 ited to designated areas and must comply with all applicable local and sta
 te regulations. Please consume responsibly.\n\nBy entering the venue\, you
  agree to comply with all house rules and venue policies.
LOCATION:The Lounge at Mercy
URL:https://eventhi.io/events/elevated-sessions-at-the-lounge-at-mercy-626
 26-13899
