DESCRIPTION:On select Fridays this summer\, immerse yourself in the enchan
 tment of our Golden Hour Series where each guest is greeted with a complim
 entary pour to start the evening right. Dive deeper into the night with ou
 r selection of wines\, available for purchase by the bottle or glass. \n\
 nDon't miss out on this quintessential summer experience—perfect for win
 e enthusiasts and sunset chasers alike!\n\n**Dates\, artists and food offe
 rings:**\n\n**Friday\, May 8th**\n\nTom Richardson Band | Taco Truck\n\n**
 Friday\, May 22nd**\n\nJason Bodlovich Trio | Chads Soup Shack\n\n**Friday
 \, June 12th**\n\nJoy Ride | Chads Soup Shack\n\n**Friday\, June 26th**\n\
 nBlues Defenders | KJ Kitchen\n\n**Friday\, July 10th**\n\nTaylor Mountain
  | Taco Truck\n\n**Friday\, July 24th**\n\nSon Chevere\n\n**Friday\, Augus
 t 7th**\n\nTommy Thomsen\n\n**Friday\, August 21st**\n\nSwing Fling | KJ K
 itchen\n\n**Friday\, September 11th**\n\nThird Rail Band | Chads Soup Shac
 k\n\n**Friday\, September 25th**\n\nThe Dorian Mode | Taco Truck
LOCATION:Matanza Creek Winery
URL:https://www.matanzascreek.com/golden-hour.html
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
