 or\, and singers from the West Coast cities and Baltimore-D.C.\, led by He
 ather MacLaughlin Garbes and Crista Berryessa. We’ll celebrate Jaanipäe
 v with cultural workshops\, games\, Midsummer Market\, activities for the 
