 ing a showy song-and-dance personal essay and charming her way into law sc
 hool. Befriending classmate\, Emmett\, and spunky hairdresser\, Paulette\,
  along the way\, Elle finds that books and looks aren't mutually exclusive
 .  As Elle begins outsmarting her peers\, she realizes that law may be her
  natural calling after all. Door open: 2:00pm TICKETS ZONE A \\(Close to t
