UID:260514Z93KBJFz5UyDREo022QK8Q
DESCRIPTION:$25 General Admission Doors at 7:30pm. Show from 8:15-10:30pm 
 with one intermission All-Ages are welcome SOL FLAMENCO featuring... Singe
 r: Jimmie Ramos Dancers: Damien Álvarez & Joelle Goncalves Guitarist: Mar
 k Taylor Experience the passionate and vibrant art of flamenco with Sol Fl
 amenco\, a professional ensemble bringing the heart of Spain directly to T
 he Lost Church. Once the show ignites\, prepare for a high-energy and auth
 entic flamenco journey. Our artists have honed their craft in Spain\, the 
 very birthplace of flamenco. Witness the fiery footwork\, expressive movem
 ents\, soulful melodies\, and intricate rhythms that define this iconic ar
 t form\, delivered with an energy that will leave you breathless and exhil
 arated. Sol Flamenco is an electrifying evening of phenomenal music and da
 nce that will carry you into a world of passion that is unique to flamenco
 . Olé! www.solflamenco.com https://www.facebook.com/sol.flamencodance htt
 ps://www.instagram.com/solflamenco https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B1A9pc8
 RI38&t=4s Recommended if you like: Flamenco is a rich\, syncretic art form
  originating in Andalusia\, Spain\, heavily influenced by the cultural syn
 thesis of Gitano \\(Roma\\)\, Moorish \\(Arab\\)\, Jewish\, and native And
 alusian folk traditions. It was shaped by centuries of cultural exchange\,
  incorporating melodic lines from Islamic music\, rhythmic complexity from
  South Asia\, and later\, harmonic elements from Latin America.
