DESCRIPTION:Join us Sunday\, June 26 | 11:00 AM – 1:30 PM for a hands-on
  harvest experience\, garden-fresh lunch\, and beautiful wines—all set i
 n the stunning estate gardens of Bricoleur Vineyards. \n\nLed by Estate G
 arden Manager Farmer Mikey\, this intimate experience invites you to harve
 st fresh seasonal produce\, learn the art of timing and flavor\, and enjoy
  a garden-inspired lunch paired with exceptional wines—all surrounded by
  stunning estate gardens. \n\n$150 per ticket | Only 15 spots available 
 \n\nGet tickets here: https://hbginbloom2026.ggo.bid/n/package/15104474 
