 r Mornings \n\n$2.00 discounts on each admission for up to six additional
  guests \n\nDiscounted rates on Gift Corner purchases\, Private Playdates
 \, birthday parties\, and admission to select events \n\n$1.00 discounts 
 on each admission for up to four persons to the Schulz Museum and Snoopy
 ’s Home Ice Arena \n\nFree coffee for Museum Members every second Sund
 ay of the month during Sunday Member Mornings.\n\n\n\nInterested in becomi
 ng a member? Check out our affordable Membership Levels here.
