BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Film Series at The Madrona
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T210000
UID:2606126lhYw1f2D0mVo4BUmMkeBA
DESCRIPTION:The Summer Film Series at The Madrona is a thoughtfully curate
 d outdoor program in partnership with True West Film Center and a rotating
  roster of local wine partners. The experience kicked off in May and conti
 nues on the first Wednesday of each month through October**\,** transformi
 ng the hotel’s eight-acre hillside estate into an open-air cinema set ag
 ainst sweeping Sonoma views.\n\nEach evening begins at golden hour\, with 
 guests invited to settle into the lawn with a glass of local wine\, surrou
 nded by lush gardens and the historic 1881 estate. Tickets are available o
 n OpenTable for $61.20 per person and include event admission\, popcorn an
 d a snack\, a complimentary glass of wine from a winery partner\, personal
  headphones\, and cozy blankets and seating tufts designed by Northern Cal
 ifornian designer Erica Tavov.\n\nThe 2026 lineup leans into iconic\, feel
 -good films that complement the nostalgic ease of summer evenings with the
  future showings listed below:\n\n·       **July 1** – A League o
 f Their Own\n\n·       **August 5** – Back to the Future\n\n· 
       **September 2** – Clueless\n\n·       **October 7** 
 – Audience Choice: E.T.\, Zombieland\, or Death Becomes Her
LOCATION:The Madrona
URL:https://themadronahotel.com/summer-film-series/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
