DESCRIPTION:Twelve Sonoma County artists will “SCREAM” together in a m
 iniature exhibit. The exhibit\, as well as every individual artwork in the
  show share the same title: SCREAM.\n\nThe miniature FUN SIZE Blasted Art 
 Gallery\, which measures 16 x 33 x 21”\, serves as a portable vessel for
  this chorus of artists\, was created as a timely response to global\, nat
 ional\, local\, and personal issues.\n\nThese artists will be SCREAMing to
 gether: Arminée Chahbazian\, Art Moura\, Bill Shelley\, Britta Kathmeyer\
 , Carlos Perez\, Chris Beards\, Jennifer Mygatt Tatum\, Kathleen Youngquis
 t\, Keviette Minor\, Kristen Throop\, Nick Mancillas\, and Nicole Mathers.
 \n\nThe Thursday\, July 2 Grand Opening at Rena Charles Gallery \\(439 Hea
 ldsburg Ave.\, Healdsburg\\) is from 5-7pm\, coinciding with Art Nite Heal
 dsburg First Thursday.\n\nIf you miss Thursday's event\, the following nig
 ht\, Friday\, July 3 Opening Reception is at the Santa Rosa Arts Center in
  the SOFA Arts District \\(312 South A Street\, Santa Rosa\\) at 5-8pm\, c
 oinciding with SOFA Arts District First Friday. \n\nBoth events are free.
 \n\nSCREAM and FUN SIZE Blasted Art Gallery are a project of Blasted Art G
 allery \\(Santa Rosa artists Chris Beards & Bill Shelley\\)\, which presen
 ted gallery exhibits featuring Sonoma County artists from 2017 to 2019 in 
 the SOFA Arts District in Santa Rosa\, and online in 2020.
LOCATION:Rena Charles Gallery
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/scream-at-fun-size-blas
 ted-art-gallery/19154704/2026-07-02T17
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
