 ld friends\, we invite you to settle in\, sip back\, and make unforgettabl
 e memories in the heart of our estate.\n\n**Dates:** June 7 | July 5 | Au
 gust 2 **Time:** 11:00am-4:00pm **Location:** Seghesio Family Vineyards 
 700 Grove Street Healdsburg\, CA 95448 **Ticket Price:** Entry is free.
