UID:260506UZ3MqdTmEk2vlqlz1x7_2Q
DESCRIPTION:Santa Rosa’s Wednesday Night Market is Sonoma County’s pre
 mier street fair. Local community and visiting tourists come out in big nu
 mbers to celebrate the spirit of Sonoma County every Wednesday for 14 week
 s. With an average nightly attendance of  7\,000 – 9\,000 people Wednesd
 ay Night Market is the perfect opportunity for businesses to connect with 
 a large and local audience.\n\nCelebrating Community for 37 years on the b
 eautiful Courthouse Square in downtown Santa Rosa\, the Wednesday Night Ma
 rket Board of Directors produces this free event for the whole family. Loc
 ated 50 miles North of San Francisco in Sonoma County Wine Country the Wed
 nesday Night Market brings wine country life together in one place with th
 e finest local street foods\, sweet treats\, artists\, wellness products\,
  community non-profit groups\, exhibits and a live concert every Wednesday
 \, May through August. Guests sip local microbrews and wines as they shop 
 and take home something from our amazing variety of local artists and food
  producers selling chocolates\, tie dye\, jewelry\, candles\, teas\, cooki
 es\, crystals\, cheeses\, hummus and more. Families have fun in the Kids S
 pace and Exhibitor Area.
LOCATION:Downtown Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/108314719?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
