BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:50% Off Tastings For FIFA Ticketholders at Whitehall Lane Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T170000
UID:260602cJFnkXclsUyf8QC--QMkRQ
DESCRIPTION:Show a valid FIFA event ticket to receive 50% off the Winery E
 xclusive Flight at Whitehall Lane Winery. Wine educators guide guests thro
 ugh an elevated tasting experience in the winery or on the outdoor patio. 
 Guests will enjoy five limited-production wines from the family’s eight 
 estate vineyards\, including vineyard-designated Cabernets\, paired with a
  small cheese accompaniment.\n\nReservations can be booked through TOCK\, 
 and the promotional discount will be refunded upon arrival with a valid ev
 ent ticket! For questions\, please contact the tasting room at \\(707\\) 9
 63-6454 or by email greatwine@whitehalllane.com.\n\nCharcuterie\, boxed lu
 nches\, and shareable items are available with a minimum 72-hour notice.
LOCATION:Whitehall Lane Winery
URL:https://whitehalllane.com/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
