BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Festival Napa Valley's Music & Wellness Summit
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260710T150000
UID:260504ZHr1LgoqUkmd8axZnoeEiA
DESCRIPTION:Festival Napa Valley presents a one-day gathering exploring th
 e powerful connection between music\, brain science\, and wellness. Leadin
 g neuroscientists\, psychologists\, entrepreneurs\, and musicians will sha
 re insights on music’s impact on brain health\, community well-being\, s
 enior wellness\, and youth mental health. The program will also highlight 
 scientifically grounded medical practices that harness the therapeutic pow
 er of music.   Internationally acclaimed opera singer and arts and health
  advocate Renée Fleming will deliver the keynote address. Additional spe
 akers include Aniruddh D. Patel\, PhD.\, Tufts University\; Chris Appleton
 \, Founder & CEO of SocialRX\; Dr. Indre Viskontas\, MM\, PhD\, University
  of San Francisco\, San Francisco Conservatory of Music\, & Reverberation\
 ; Francisco J. Núñez\, Founder & Artistic Director of the Young People
 ’s Chorus of New York City\; and Gary Muszynski\, Founder & CEO of Orche
 strating Excellence.   The day features engaging expert talks\, case stud
 ies\, and interactive workshops\, along with a captivating Festival Live!
  concert. Attendees can also explore a free\, day-long resource exposition
  in the atrium showcasing organizations working at the intersection of mus
 ic\, health\, and community care.
LOCATION:CIA at Copia
URL:https://festivalnapavalley.org/calendar/music-wellness-summit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
