 h frontman James Petralli has since relocated to Los Angeles\, the group q
 uickly built a reputation for electrifying live shows and adventurous musi
 cianship\, earning comparisons to both classic rock icons and modern innov
 ators. Their 2008 debut Workout Holiday established them as genre-defying 
 outsiders\, while later releases such as Corsicana Lemonade in 2013 showca
 sed a more polished but no less daring approach. At the heart of the band
 ’s vision is frontman James Petralli\, whose distinctive voice\, sharp g
 uitar work\, and inventive songwriting anchor White Denim’s sound. His d
 ynamic presence both in the studio and on stage has made him one of the mo
 st compelling frontmen in modern rock\, ensuring White Denim remains one o
